<div id="A1.SS1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS1.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">MMORE</span> supports a wide range of file formats through modular extractors. For each supported type, we define a <span id="A1.SS1.p2.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">default mode</span> prioritizing accuracy and a <span id="A1.SS1.p2.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">fast mode</span> optimized for speed. When no alternative tool is available, the fast mode is left unspecified (–). A complete list of tools used per file type is shown in Table <a href="#A1.T4" title="Table 4 ‣ A.1 Document Ingestion ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ MMORE: Massive Multimodal Open RAG &amp; Extraction" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a>.</p>
</div>
