</span>
<span id="A1.SS2.p2.pic1.p3" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A1.SS2.p2.pic1.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p2.pic1.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">The standardized format for document processing.<span id="A1.SS2.p2.pic1.p3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span>
